# | Advantech ADAM-4051 — 16-Channel Isolated Digital Input with LED Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 10)
# | - 16-channel isolated digital input with LED status indicators.
# | - Modbus RTU, FC01/FC02 for input state (coil registers — NOT FC03).
# | - FC01/FC02 00001-00016 (coil addr 0-15): DI Input Signal ch0-15 (R).
# | - FC03 40211 (addr 210): Module Name 1 (R, 0x40 0x55).
# | - FC03 40212 (addr 211): Module Name 2 (R, 0x00 0x00).
# | - FC03 40213 (addr 212): Firmware Version 1 (R).
# | - FC03 40214 (addr 213): Firmware Version 2 (R).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
# | - NOTE: DI state uses coil function codes FC01/FC02, not FC03.
